                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This week, I presented my top priority to the House Ways and Means Committee, raising the SALT cap. We Long Islanders aren\u2019t asking for special treatment\u2014we just want our fair share. A recent study shows that New Yorkers get a mere 74 cents for every dollar sent to Washington while other states receive much more than they give. This is about equity and fairness and I won\u2019t stop till we fix the SALT cap.",
